{\pard \fs18 \i [Meta title]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 About K Films \u8212? Motorcycle Wraps in Jersey City\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Meta description]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 K Films is a one-person motorcycle and helmet wrap garage in Jersey City, built by a rider for riders across NYC and North Jersey.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? eyebrow]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Who we are\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? h1]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 One rider, one garage\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? lede]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 K Films is a motorcycle and helmet wrap shop in Jersey City. Not a chain, not a franchise, and not an automotive shop that also does bikes.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? Card \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? eyebrow]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Jersey City, NJ\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? Card \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? h2]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Elombe Kisala\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? Card \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? lede]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 I ride, and I wrap bikes one set of hands at a time. Motorcycles are the whole business \u8212? not a sideline to a car shop.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? Card \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Right now I\u8217?m taking a limited number of founding builds \u8212? 6 of 8 still open \u8212? at the early rate. I don\u8217?t have a catalog of client wraps or YouTube episodes yet. That\u8217?s the whole point of the founding slots: the portfolio gets built in public, on real bikes, instead of appearing fully formed one day.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? Card \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 What a founding rider gets is the early price and premium cast film, panels off, edges wrapped properly \u8212? the same work I\u8217?ll be charging more for once those slots are gone.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? Card \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? CTA]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Get a quote\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? Card \u183? Elombe Kisala \u183? CTA]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Follow @kisalafilms\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? How the work gets done \u183? eyebrow]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 What we stand on\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? How the work gets done \u183? h2]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 How the work gets done\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? How the work gets done \u183? Benefit \u183? Practise on my own bike first \u183? h3]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Practise on my own bike first\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? How the work gets done \u183? Benefit \u183? Practise on my own bike first \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 My bike takes the learning curve so yours doesn\u8217?t. No shortcuts sold as finished mastery.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? How the work gets done \u183? Benefit \u183? Motorcycles only \u183? h3]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Motorcycles only\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? How the work gets done \u183? Benefit \u183? Motorcycles only \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Bike bodywork behaves nothing like a car door. Specialising is the point.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? How the work gets done \u183? Benefit \u183? Panels off, edges wrapped \u183? h3]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Panels off, edges wrapped\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? How the work gets done \u183? Benefit \u183? Panels off, edges wrapped \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Slower, and the only way the film stays where it was put.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? How the work gets done \u183? Benefit \u183? Local and straight with you \u183? h3]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Local and straight with you\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? How the work gets done \u183? Benefit \u183? Local and straight with you \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 You deal with me. Clear prices, honest timelines, and a plain answer if something is a bad idea.\par}
