{\pard \fs18 \i [Meta title]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Motorcycle Wraps in Jersey City, NJ \u8212? K Films\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Meta description]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Motorcycle wrap film in Jersey City, NJ. Cast vinyl colour changes, chrome delete and tank protection from a one-person garage. Ride in by appointment or have your bike collected from $75.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? eyebrow]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Jersey City, NJ\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? h1]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Motorcycle wraps in Jersey City\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? lede]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 This is the garage. Not a franchise counter with a queue behind it \u8212? one bench, one installer, and your bike on it for two or three days. Every wrap K Films does is cut and installed here in Jersey City, whether the bike started in Bergen-Lafayette or came over from Bushwick in the van.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? CTA]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Get a quote\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? CTA]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 See pricing\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Jersey City, NJ, specifically \u183? eyebrow]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 What this looks like from where you are\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Jersey City, NJ, specifically \u183? h2]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Jersey City, NJ, specifically\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Jersey City, NJ, specifically \u183? Card \u183? You can just ride it over \u183? h3]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 You can just ride it over\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Jersey City, NJ, specifically \u183? Card \u183? You can just ride it over \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Downtown, Journal Square, the Heights, Greenville, West Side \u8212? nowhere in Jersey City is a long ride to the garage. Drop-off is by appointment and costs nothing, and we lock the window once the quote is agreed so your bike isn\u8217?t sitting around waiting on me.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Jersey City, NJ, specifically \u183? Card \u183? Or don't, and I'll come to you \u183? h3]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Or don't, and I'll come to you\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Jersey City, NJ, specifically \u183? Card \u183? Or don't, and I'll come to you \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Plenty of riders here keep the bike in a shared garage, a driveway they share with three neighbours, or on the street under a cover. If moving it is the annoying part, pickup starts at $75 and I\u8217?ll handle it.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Jersey City, NJ, specifically \u183? Card \u183? Winter is the honest time to do this \u183? h3]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Winter is the honest time to do this\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Jersey City, NJ, specifically \u183? Card \u183? Winter is the honest time to do this \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 A wrap needs the bike off the road for a couple of days, and warm panels take film better than cold ones. If you\u8217?re laying the bike up over a Jersey winter anyway, that\u8217?s the cheapest downtime you\u8217?ll ever spend.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? eyebrow]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Getting the bike here\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? h2]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Three ways, one of them free\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? lede]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Jersey City is the one place on this site where you have a genuinely free option: ride in, hand me the keys, no transport line on the quote. Transport is quoted with the build, never charged up front.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? Card \u183? Ride it in \u183? h3]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Ride it in\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? Card \u183? Ride it in \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Straight to the garage, by appointment. Nothing added to the quote.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? Card \u183? I collect it \u183? h3]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 I collect it\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? Card \u183? I collect it \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 The van comes to you and the bike goes back to the bench. Tell me where it\u8217?s parked and whether it runs.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? Card \u183? Collect and deliver back \u183? h3]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Collect and deliver back\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? Card \u183? Collect and deliver back \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Picked up before the build, delivered back after. You never move it yourself.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? CTA]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Price it with pickup\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Three ways, one of them free \u183? CTA]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 The whole run\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? The first 8 builds set the rate. \u183? eyebrow]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Founding riders\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? The first 8 builds set the rate. \u183? h2]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 The first 8 builds set the rate.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? The first 8 builds set the rate. \u183? body]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 I\u8217?m building this portfolio in public and the riders who come in early get the founding rate for it \u8212? 6 still open. Same cast film, same panels-off install.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? The first 8 builds set the rate. \u183? CTA]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 See the rates\par}
