{\pard \fs22 Jersey City, NJ questions\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [FAQ \u183? question]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Where in Jersey City are you?\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [FAQ \u183? answer]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 The garage is in Jersey City, NJ and it\u8217?s appointment-only, so the exact address goes out with your confirmed booking rather than sitting on a public page. Hours are Monday to Friday, 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM, with weekends by arrangement.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [FAQ \u183? question]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Do I need an appointment?\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [FAQ \u183? answer]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Yes. There is one bay and one person in it, so turning up unannounced means waiting or coming back. Send a build sheet through the Wrap Studio and we\u8217?ll fix a window.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [FAQ \u183? question]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 How long will my bike be with you?\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [FAQ \u183? answer]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Two to three days for most builds. A full colour change on a fully faired bike takes longer than accents on a naked, because more of the bike has to come apart first.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Section \u183? Jersey City, NJ questions \u183? CTA]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 All the questions\par}
