{\pard \fs22 Straight answer first: there is no K Films shop in Brooklyn. There is one garage, and it\u8217?s in Jersey City. What Brooklyn gets is the van \u8212? I collect the bike from your kerb, wrap it on the bench in Jersey City, and bring it back. I\u8217?d rather tell you that than dress up a pickup radius as a second location.\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? CTA]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Get a quote\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? CTA]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 See pricing\par}
