{\pard \fs18 \i [Hero \u183? lede]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Wrapping a bike in New York has one real obstacle, and it isn\u8217?t the wrap. It\u8217?s that everything involves moving the bike somewhere, and moving the bike somewhere in this city is never simple. So I move it. The van collects from Manhattan and the outer boroughs, the film goes on at the Jersey City garage, and the bike comes back to you.\par}
