{\pard \fs18 \i [FAQ \u183? question]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Which boroughs do you collect from?\par}
{\pard \fs18 \i [FAQ \u183? answer]\i0\par}
{\pard \fs22 Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, the Bronx and Staten Island. Pickup starts at $75. If you\u8217?re further out than that, say where you are in the Wrap Studio and I\u8217?ll tell you honestly whether I can reach you rather than quote first and work it out later.\par}
